{:event/actor "seb" :event/at #inst "2026-11-03T08:18:30.429Z" :event/body {:fact/path [:summary] :fact/value "rollout reports children whose repository is absent or out of scope, and with --retire records a signed [:population :left] fact naming the reason. A sticky terminal stage guarded on it settles the ticket. A returning repository gets a fresh ticket (the departure count is part of its id); unanswered scope checks and settled children are never retired. Opt-in because a partial checkout looks like deleted repositories."} :event/parents #{"sha256-33de12c959698794f533fca1ec54881a8d4daa5f208060eb01513a81c4214d85"} :event/ticket #uuid "2e3674af-f73a-4e09-a297-1b2e187bd67c" :event/type :fact/assert}